# From SQLite's sqllogictest corpus (https://www.sqlite.org/sqllogictest,
# mirrored at https://github.com/gregrahn/sqllogictest): test/random/expr/slt_good_0.test,
# up to its 200th query this engine runs. Its COPYRIGHT lets it be copied
# freely. `skipif transformer <id>` marks a record the engine answers
# otherwise by design, with the id of its rule in the ledger in
# docs/gotchas.md.

